---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Crumbs from '../components/Crumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Crossroad Leads collects and uses information submitted through crossroadleads.com.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <Crumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
      <h1>Privacy <span class="hl">Policy</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: September 30, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit a form on this website, I collect the information you provide: typically your name, email address, phone number, business name, website, and the service you're interested in. I also may collect basic, anonymous analytics data such as pages visited and general location (city level).</p>
      <h2>How it's used</h2>
      <p>Your information is used only to respond to your inquiry, prepare your free audit, and communicate with you about services you requested. I do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      <h2>Form processing</h2>
      <p>Form submissions are processed by <a href="https://web3forms.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Web3Forms</a>, which delivers your message to my email inbox. Their handling of data is governed by their own privacy policy.</p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>This site is hosted on Cloudflare, which may process technical information (such as IP addresses) to deliver and secure the website.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask me to delete any information you've submitted at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or calling <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
